# The payloads of abl/release.env's release: <SoC> <size> <sha256>, taken from
# the machine that built them (build/out/*.sha256), never from the release's
# tarball, so a payload changed or swapped on the way fails the image build. The
# rows in releases.tsv must say the same.
SM8550 UNFILLED UNFILLED
SM8650 UNFILLED UNFILLED
SM7750 UNFILLED UNFILLED
